Native app security/no-claim proof:

- Native app budget decisions consume stored session references rather than
  portal timer refresh state.
- Foreground-only app budgets do not count background duration.
- Risk-app targets remain contract targets; WP17 live risk app detection is
  still open because `packages/activity-domain` is locked by codex-a.
- Bonus-time extension requires approval and audit refs.
- Dry-run/manual-required states do not execute adapters.
- No private app paths, command lines, child content, screenshots, raw journal
  rows, SQLite rows, or tokens are introduced by this slice.
